  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.7,
      426.78,
      286.48,
      553.92
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire land located between Dehiwala-Maharagama (119) bus route and Maharagama-Moratuwa (192) bus route to create a water reserve to collect storm water temporarily in Attidiya, Bellanthara paddy field under Weras Ganga Water Drainage and Environment Improvement Project.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672,
      10.979999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.7,
      554.29,
      286.47,
      652.8
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired: An allotment of land in total extent of 1.9251 Hectare, depicted as Lot No. 01 in the Preliminary Plan No. 9465 dated 27.03.2015 prepared by the Surveyor General situated in the village called Bellanthara in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 535/A of Bellanwila in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kesbewa in Colombo District of the Western Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      64.5,
      667.03,
      129.25,
      678.12
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 01",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.7,
      681.97,
      324.08,
      716.04
    ],
    "text": "Name of the land: Kadurugaha Kumbura; Description: Paddy field; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Mr. Gupthadewa Ranjan Dias Abegunawardhana and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.38,
      354.25,
      539.84,
      388.32
    ],
    "text": "Mrs. Nalini Dias Abegunawardhana, No. 78, Alakeshwara Road, Ethul Kotte, Kotte; Extent: 1.9251 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.38,
      388.75,
      539.81,
      606.78
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands* on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Sri Lanka Land Reclamation and Development Corporation, No. 03, Sri Jayawardenapura Mawatha, Welikada, Rajagiriya on the 18th day of May, 2015 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 11th day of May, 2015 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude*, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. C. W. ABEYSURIYA, Acquiring Officer, Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division, Kesbewa.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.980000019073486,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
